  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rural Water Supply and Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s development objective is to ensure access to improved and sustained water and sanitation services in rural communities in Tanzania.  This would be accomplished through the implementation of the new Rural Water Supply and Sanitation (RWSS) sector policy and the preparation of a National RWSS program.  To this end, the Project would support a decentralized and demand responsive delivery mechanism and help build the institutional foundation for implementing the National RWSS Program both at the central and local governments levels.</narrative>
  </description>
